          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "TRANSPOSE\n\nThe Transpose node transposes the matrix of the input.\n\nWhen working with textures this means that the pixels are seen as a matrix and are transposed. This effectively means the resolution gets flipped. "
          }
        },
