          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "EXAMPLE I : TRANSPOSING A TEXTURE\n\nHere we convert a Linear into a texture of 10x1 pixels.\nNext we transpose it, turning it into a 1x10 pixels texture."
          }
