          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "EXAMPLE II : VIDEO OSCILLATOR\n\nHere we create a simple video oscillator by sending an instanced Sine into a Texture from Data node.\nNext we Transpose it to create a \"rotated\" copy.\nWe use the transposed texture to offset the original texture to create a squiggly visual."
          }
        },
